Step 1: Define the JSON Schema
To start off, we need to define the JSON schema that will be used to store the various plot points and details of the story. Here's an example schema that we can use:
```json
{
  "title": "Jungle Story",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "characters": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "name": {"type": "string"},
