Sure, here are three different methods to calculate the sum of all elements in an array:
Method 1: Using a for loop
```java
int[] arr = new int[1000];
int sum = 0;
for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
    sum += arr[i];
}
System.out.println("Sum of all elements: " + sum);
```
```python
