public static boolean isLeapYear(int year) {
    if (year % 4 == 0) {
        if (year % 100 == 0) {
            if (year % 400 == 0) {
                return true;
            }
            return false;
        }
        return true;
    }
    return false;
}
```
And here's the code to determine the number of leap years between two given years:
```java
public static int numberOfLeapYears(int startYear, int endYear) {
    int count = 0;
    for (int year = startYear; year <= endYear; year++) {
        if (isLeapYear(year)) {
            count++;
        }
    }
    return count;
}
```
